<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>Right-click a widget while editing to change its settings.</FluentText>

    <HelpSection Title="For everyone">
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Greeting</strong>: says hello to whoever is signed in.</li>
            <li><strong>Digital Clock</strong>: 24-hour, date and milliseconds options.</li>
            <li><strong>Text Area</strong>: your own formatted text.</li>
            <li><strong>Announcements</strong>: live announcements for the viewer's location, pinned first.</li>
            <li><strong>My Training</strong>: the viewer's own courses.</li>
            <li><strong>My Shifts</strong>: the viewer's upcoming shifts, and optionally time off.</li>
            <li><strong>Who's On Today</strong>: who's working at a location today, and optionally who's clocked in.</li>
        </ul>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="For managers">
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Time Off to Approve</strong>: requests waiting for the viewer.</li>
            <li><strong>Compliance at a Glance</strong>: overdue training and expired or expiring documents.</li>
            <li><strong>Demand and Staffing</strong>: labour hours per game, and the hours most out of line with staffing.</li>
        </ul>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Venue technology">
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Laser Game Status</strong> and <strong>Laser Scoreboard</strong>: the current game for a client.</li>
            <li><strong>Hall of Fame</strong>: top scores, best accuracy and team totals for a period. It updates as
                soon as a game ends.</li>
            <li><strong>Music Playlist Selector</strong> and <strong>Music Timeline</strong>: choose a playlist, see what's
                playing, and skip.</li>
            <li><strong>Projection Status</strong>: what's showing on a screen, with optional pause, skip and stop.</li>
            <li><strong>Button</strong>: runs a projection program action, such as start, pause or next step. Only
                Admins and Managers can press it.</li>
            <li><strong>Automation Rule Status</strong>: whether a rule is on and when it last ran. Admins can turn it on
                or off.</li>
            <li><strong>Kiosk Health</strong>: which kiosks are online, struggling or offline.</li>
        </ul>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
